Subject: [PATCH 114/138] media: apple: t7000 ISP: IPC ring service (TERMINAL,
 SHAREDMALLOC)

WIP piece 1 of the stage 7-9 IPC code: slot helpers, TERMINAL printing
(bounded to 0x80 bytes), SHAREDMALLOC alloc/free through the mini DART,
generic type 1/2 drain and the service pass (mailbox ack 0x40100 ->
0xc050c).

